# Rakuda visual meshes (53 MB of decorative STL) live in Git LFS. The URDFs and
# the convex collision meshes are ordinary git files, so a plain clone can run
# the kinematics, the solver and the collision-geometry viewer without LFS.
# Fetch the visual meshes with:  git lfs install && git lfs pull
models/rakuda/assembly_2/meshes/*.stl filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
models/rakuda/assembly_2/meshes/*.STL filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
